  "text": "Just for reference... This is my personal EMA system that I have been using for years.\n\nIts really helpful...\n\n13 / 48 / 200 EMA's on the 2 minute chart.\n\nBullish EMA trend 📈\n\n13 EMA on top 🟡\n48 EMA in middle 🟣\n200 EMA on bottom 🔴\n\nBearish EMA trend 📉\n\n200 EMA on top 🔴\n48 https://t.co/1IlM5HxMuQ",
